n      seed_x_item_contribution_pct: 28\n      ordering_residual_contribution_pct: 40\n    item_id_pct_CI_95:\n    - 56.8\n    - 65.4\n    model_x_item_4model_pct_CI_95:\n    - 3.1\n    - 12.8\n    residual_pct_CI_95:\n    - 15.3\n    - 23.1\n    G_binary_CI_95:\n    - 0.571\n    - 0.652\n    cross_model_G_4model_CI_95:\n    - 0.22\n    - 0.4\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_mean: 1.01\n    bootstrap_jackknife_CI_width_ratio_range:\n    - 0.96\n    - 1.04\n    G_all_random: 0.594\n    G_temp_fixed: 0.628\n    G_ordering_fixed: 0.641\n    G_both_fixed: 0.664\n    fixed_random_max_delta_G: 0.07\n    d_study_items_G80_practical: 468\n    d_study_items_G80_all_random: 498\n    d_study_items_G90_practical: 1240\n    d_study_items_G90_all_random: 1380\n    d_study_14k_items_G_projected: 0.972\n    bernoulli_variance_obs_variance_corr: 0.91\n    null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n    obs_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n    min_detectable_interaction_pct: 0.8\n    power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.94\n    power_at_5pct_interaction: 0.99\n    gpu_hours_for_G80_budget: 340\n    gpu_hours_for_G90_budget: 890\n  result_rationale: 'IRT vs G-theory对比是worst档中最重要的surviving finding。ratio降至3.3-3.5×\n    (vs原预期的3.6-4.4×)因为：(1) IRT在4-model数据上估计更保守(142 items vs 原2-model数据的116 items)，缩小了分母差距；(2)\n    G-theory的D-study在4-model 分析中因model×item降至7.3%而需要fewer items来compensate，numerator从510\n    降至498。但3.3×仍然是substantial——意味着IRT忽略的facets(prompt, seed, ordering) 贡献了约70%的额外item需求。这个finding不依赖model×item的magnitude，因此\n    在worst档中仍然robust。 Bootstrap CIs显示item_id的95% CI为[56.8, 65.4]，range=8.6pp——与exp-001b的\n    resampling变异一致，进一步确认point estimate的精度有限。model×item的4-model CI为[3.1, 12.8]，range很宽(9.7pp)，包含0附近——reviewer可能argue\n    \"model×item is not reliably different from zero with only 4 models\"。这是对原Claim\n    1的 又一打击：不仅point estimate从26%降至7%，CI还包含了trivially small values。 Fixed vs random\n    sensitivity分析显示delta仅0.070——这是一个正面结果，说明 facet classification choice对G影响不大，MD2\n    defense成立。 D-study投影到14K items给出G=0.97